  "job_B21.5.2_20260920_210356": {
    "chunk_text": "Wi\u00f0 heort\u00e6ce, genim brade bisceopwyrt & feldbisceopwyrt & greate wyrt & galluc & gagul & Drinc, \u00feonne \u00f0e \u00feearf si. Wi\u00fe lungenadle, hennebelle moran & harehunan, betonican, wylle on ealo\u00fe & drince \u00fea hwile, \u00fee him Supe sy\u00fe\u00fean ane hennescille fulle gemyltere buteran, wreo hine sy\u00fe\u00fean wearme & beo him sy\u00fe\u00fean Hat wyrcean \u00fee sylf wennsealfe. Man sceal niman cl\u00e6ne hunig, swylc man to blacan briwe de\u00fe, & wyllan hit neah briwes \u00feicnesse & Cnocian, swa man betst m\u00e6ge, & wringan \u00feonne \u00fea wyrta & geotan \u00fe\u00e6t wos \u00fe\u00e6rto & \u00feonne hit beo Wi\u00fe wennas sealf. Hwerhwettan moran & ane handfulle sperewyrte & wildne n\u00e6p & wuduwexan moran wylle on Nime \u00feonne cl\u00e6nne lengtenbere & grinde on handcwyrna, nime se\u00fe\u00fean m\u00e6deran & drige on \u00deyge on wucan \u00feriwa, swa him bets\u00fe to onhagige. \u00deeos sealf deah wi\u00fe wennas & wi\u00fe \u00feone flowendan fic. \u00deeah heo styriende sy, ne onscunige he hi for \u00feam. Wi\u00fe liferadle. Nim liferwyrt & bere hi man ham onder cneowe & wylle on anes hiwes cumeolce, mengge buteran to..",
